    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Citizen Zein is a narrative role\u2014playing game with Point'n'Click elements.<br>You are a retired military man who has just returned to his hometown. Now you are free to choose your own path. But remember that every choice has consequences. Not only for you, but also for those who are dear to you... and who cares about you...<br>Please choose wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br>- Calm narrative gameplay;<br>- Puzzles and mini-games;<br>- Variability based on two main attributes of the hero;<br>- Hand-drawn and animated characters and locations;<br>- Several different endings;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/bd052eb90886fea2803ad7a1793628b4.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Citizen Zein is a narrative role\u2014playing game with Point'n'Click elements.<br>You are a retired military man who has just returned to his hometown. Now you are free to choose your own path. But remember that every choice has consequences. Not only for you, but also for those who are dear to you... and who cares about you...<br>Please choose wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/ecb33962fe7d5928b2dc7607d5b20aa4.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br>- Calm narrative gameplay;<br>- Puzzles and mini-games;<br>- Variability based on two main attributes of the hero;<br>- Hand-drawn and animated characters and locations;<br>- Several different endings;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.poster.avif?t=1707298804\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.webm?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717720/extras/dc5fb2cb11ef83e73ee37698622e55ac.mp4?t=1707298804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
